  "imageContext": "Image alt: When constructing a Business Plan, ask the following questions: How can I manage and juggle the related operational and administrative responsibilities for the venture? How quickly (or slowly) should I grow the venture? Potential Obstacles include Limited experience or knowledge of the operational and administrative needs of a business, and Limited access to resources and a support system.\nButton label: Click to enlarge image of When constructing a Business Plan, ask the following questions: How can I manage and juggle the related operational and administrative responsibilities for the venture? How quickly (or slowly) should I grow the venture? Potential Obstacles include Limited experience or knowledge of the operational and administrative needs of a business, and Limited access to resources and a support system.\nEnglish caption: Figure 2.10 Writing a business plan before launching a venture can give you important insights into your idea and can help you modify your business before launch to give it a better chance of success. (attribution: Copyright Rice University, OpenStax, under CC BY NC-SA 4.0 license)",
